                  "value": "This dataset contains data, per H2020 sub-programme. The data displays the total number of publications per sub-programme, per topic, as well as the number of EC sponsored publications and share of EC sponsored publications per top percentile (Top1% and Top10%). The dataset also contain data and metrics specifying the prominence (momentum) and emergence (novelty) of the sponsored publications by topic."
